{
  "_comment": "Curated Solana program registry for the on-chain DeFi footprint scanner (stocks/fetch-defi-footprint.mjs). Maps a program id — or a fixed address — to the protocol it belongs to. `category` decides whether a holding is a DeFi integration (lending, dex, perps, yield-vault, vault-strategy, structured, bridge) or custody/plumbing (custody, infrastructure, aggregator), which never becomes a candidate. `usageProtocolIds` are the protocolId values defi-usage.json uses for that protocol, so a holding can be matched to a collected listing. Every program id was checked to be an executable account on mainnet (getMultipleAccounts, 2026-09-24); `verification` says how the attribution itself was established. Add a program here only with a source.",
